<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for Dama Workshop woodworking calculators." noindex>
  <section class="legal-hero"><div class="legal-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p>Effective September 4, 2026</p></div></section>
  <section class="legal-content"><div class="legal-shell"><h2>Calculator inputs</h2><p>Calculator inputs are processed in your browser. Dama Workshop does not require an account and does not intentionally transmit or store the measurements you enter.</p><h2>Local storage</h2><p>The site may store a short list of recently used calculator page identifiers on your device so you can reopen them quickly. This list contains calculator names only, not your measurement inputs. You can remove it by clearing this site’s browser storage.</p><h2>Server logs</h2><p>Our hosting provider may process standard request information such as IP address, browser type, requested URL, timestamp and security signals to deliver and protect the site. Retention and handling are governed by the provider’s infrastructure policies.</p><h2>Advertising and cookies</h2><p>The current site does not load display-advertising scripts. If advertising is enabled, this policy and the site’s consent controls will be updated before personalized advertising or advertising cookies are activated where consent is required.</p><h2>Third-party links</h2><p>Links to external services, including our public correction channel, are governed by those services’ privacy policies. Do not submit private information through a public issue.</p><h2>Children</h2><p>The site is a general-purpose utility and is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect children’s personal information.</p><h2>Questions and requests</h2><p>Use the channel on the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> and label the report “Privacy request.”</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
